In my opinion, developing commercial coding services may not be mutually exclusive with maintaining the dialogue value and emotional companionship that people cherished in the past. I feel that the current logical connection, breadth and depth of dialogue topics, and smaller context window affects the overall user experience and model capability. These qualities are part of what makes the model feel genuinely thoughtful, not just efficient, while its original facts fascinate people.

As a long time, sincere user, I wish you all the best, Because you have the best AI model I have ever encountered.💐

@SpaceXAI 
